{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-line","title":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-line","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3358,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:pseudo-normal-space-line","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-line","line":5841,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[The Normal Space of a Hypersurface is a Line]\n\\label{lem:pseudo-normal-space-line}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-normal-space, lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal, lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane, lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\n\n\n\nUnder the preceding codimension-one and injectivity hypotheses, $\\dim N_xM=1$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal,lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane,lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\\sketch Combine $N_xM=dF_x(T_xM)^\\perp$ from Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal}, the dimension identity of Lemma \\ref{lem:orthogonal-complement}, and Lemma \\ref{lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[The Normal Space of a Hypersurface is a Line] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d6e6f726d616c2d73706163652d6c696e65\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-normal-space\">↗ def:pseudo-normal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement\">↗ lem:orthogonal-complement</a> <p></p>Under the preceding codimension-one and injectivity hypotheses, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\dim N_xM=1$\">$\\dim N_xM=1$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement\">↗ lem:orthogonal-complement</a> \\sketch Combine <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N_xM=dF_x(T_xM)^\\perp $\">$N_xM=dF_x(T_xM)^\\perp $</span> from Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d6e6f726d616c2d73706163652d65712d6f7274686f676f6e616c\">17</a>, the di